-lake-id=\"uead1b183\" id=\"uead1b183\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">对于python应用我们都知道main方法是入口，它的运行代表着主线程开始工作了，我们也知道Python虚拟机里面有垃圾回收器的存在使得我们放心让main飞奔，然而这背后的故事是垃圾回收线程作为守护着主线程的守护线程默默的付出着。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u924fd3c6\" id=\"u924fd3c6\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1686645537041-10b82716-5857-4ed5-93b9-5fac6abcd914.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua35ec45a-0b1e-4272-9f02-ce22979c9ef%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud75d31df-416c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A525%2C%22height%22%3A184%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1798%2C%22originHeight%22%3A630%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Atrue%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E6%97%A7%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%9A%87%E5%B8%9D%E9%A9%BE%E5%B4%A9%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.1595%2C0.0727%2C0.7681%2C0.9388%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b2a9a2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u90f7c472%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubf587061\" id=\"ubf587061\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1686645537013-4324e1ac-a1b7-4764-a3c6-eba4310ed321.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf1c8fbd7-c955-4a88-8a02-e5c3a18221b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud75d31df-416c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A528%2C%22height%22%3A230%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1600%2C%22originHeight%22%3A696%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Atrue%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E5%A6%83%E5%AD%90%E9%99%AA%E8%91%AC%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0.1743%2C0.0709%2C0.8525%2C0.9076%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cac3a3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u65b77f3a%